			"date": "2023-06-14T21:13:14.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> on the one hand no, since I bought my machine in 2013. On the other hand maybe since I rammed it full of RAM, haha. On the gripping hand no, since 32GB seemed like the riches of Croesus when I did it but now everyone’s got that much on a thing attached to their keys or whatever. Which browser? This seems like a thing they ought to be competing in</p>",
