			"date": "2023-06-14T21:14:25.115Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@sil\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>sil</span></a></span> I have an M1 with 16GB of memory 🫣 (my primary driver is firefox)</p>",
